+/**
+ * Applies schema name to a view statement.
+ * Mirror of applyTableDefaults/applyIndexDefaults: qualify the view with the target
+ * schema so `apply schema App { view X }` creates App.X (not main.X). Without this,
+ * unqualified views default to 'main' (create-view.js), so a CHECK constraint on an
+ * App table resolving a sibling view against its own schema path ('App') fails with
+ * "Table 'X' not found in schema path: App".
